null,"hindi_text":"$c","english_text":null,"english_translation":"Maan sarovar is located on another side of Yamuna Devi, a small bridge is there to go to Maan Sarovar near Dheer Samir.","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/594ed7e71350677a49620715/maan-sarovar-or-mana-sarovar-divine-pastimes","author":"","status":"published","content_text":"$d","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/594ed7e71350677a49620715/maan-sarovar-or-mana-sarovar-divine-pastimes","slug":"man-sarovara"},{"id":"local-34","title":"श्रीकृष्ण बलराम मंदिर","category":"General","sanskrit_text":null,"hindi_text":"श्रीकृष्ण बलराम मंदिर वृंदावन में रमणरेती क्षेत्र में स्थित है। 1975 में इस्कॉन संस्थापक ए सी भक्तिवेन्द्र स्वामी प्रभुपाद द्वारा व्यक्तिगत रूप से स्थापित किया गया था।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"Sri Krishna Balaram Mandir, situated in the Raman Reti area of Vrindavan was established personally by AC Bhaktivedanta Swami Prabhupada, founder ISKCON, in 1975.","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5b2b6d489f7ab760360f9cb6/krishna-balram-temple-vrindavan-iskcon","author":"","status":"published","content_text":"श्रीकृष्ण बलराम मंदिर वृंदावन में रमणरेती क्षेत्र में स्थित है। 1975 में इस्कॉन संस्थापक ए सी भक्तिवेन्द्र स्वामी प्रभुपाद द्वारा व्यक्तिगत रूप से स्थापित किया गया था।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5b2b6d489f7ab760360f9cb6/krishna-balram-temple-vrindavan-iskcon","slug":"shrikrishn-balaram-mndira"}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$Le",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","content","children","$f","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L10",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined